.mcp.json
coverage/

# Local tooling scaffolding (editor/assistant config dropped at the repo
# root, e.g. _claude-settings/) — machine-specific, never meant to be
# committed. Root-anchored so it doesn't catch a real `_`-prefixed dir
# nested under src/ or elsewhere.
/_*/
